  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "2. Season the lomo with salt and black pepper.",
    "3. Grill the lomo for 4-5 minutes per side, or until it reaches a safe internal temperature of 145°F.",
    "4. Meanwhile, combine the pillowy, onion, garlic, peruvian, winey, and lemon juice in a bowl.",
